  "body": "Makes Lanes the default view on the Soreness tab instead of Journal.\n\nLanes answers the question the journal is kept for — how long a workout's soreness ran — so it's the right thing to land on. One-line change to the initial `view` state; the toggle still switches to Journal/Timeline.\n\nNote: the toggle order is still Journal / Timeline / Lanes, so the default now sits last in the row. Left as-is deliberately; can reorder if you want the default to lead.",
